Route-Based IPsec

Tunnel interface IP addressing must be explicitly configured for the
route-based VPN interfaces.

Phase 2 Selectors

BGP-routed tunnels use:

Local  Selector:  0.0.0.0/0
Remote Selector:  0.0.0.0/0
BGP Route Advertisement

Only the required LAN prefixes should be advertised toward GCP.

Avoid unrestricted redistribution of connected routes because this can
advertise WAN, transit, management, or other infrastructure networks.
